  "project_description": "The JWT Block is a module that contains a block with a link to an endpoint using a JWT Token, extending this block you can change the payload of the token.\n\n Works with Key and JSON Web Token Authentication (JWT) modules.\n\n Back to top \n\n Known issues \n Right now and until this issue ( https://www.drupal.org/project/jwt_block/issues/3196850 ) is fixed it just supports JWE encryption.\n\nIs dependent on JWT module and supported encription is hard-coded until this issue is fixed https://www.drupal.org/project/jwt_block/issues/3196853 \n\n Back to top \n\n Dependencies \n Modules:\n\n \n Key \n JSON Web Token Authentication (JWT) \n \n PHP Extensions:\n\n \n Requires the GMP PHP extension. \n Back to top",
